ncounter more than 100 uniquely charming angels in the vastness of space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; All babe support customizable appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Access a massive collection of costumes for free, which can be shared among all characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/0e5d92536d7a1a74dac8d0af1d9523af.poster.avif?t=1787911290\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/0e5d92536d7a1a74dac8d0af1d9523af.webm?t=1787911290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/0e5d92536d7a1a74dac8d0af1d9523af.mp4?t=1787911290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▶ Sweet Home &amp; Intimate Connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your bond with the angels, unlocking diverse special storylines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you spend time together, the higher the affection level between Miya and the Commander becomes. By interacting closely with Miya in the in-game home, you will discover new secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/924fde486c993a575c373c736eccfbed.poster.avif?t=1787911290\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/924fde486c993a575c373c736eccfbed.webm?t=1787911290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333350/extras/9